{
  "_comment": [
    "The Provetrail failure-code registry, machine-readable. CONFORMANCE.md",
    "section 6 is the prose companion; scripts/check_suite.py enforces that the",
    "two agree and that every code a manifest pins has a 'pinned' entry here",
    "whose pinned_by list matches the manifests exactly.",
    "",
    "status: pinned = backed by published vectors (pinned_by lists them);",
    "operational = verifier-side, emitted where no vector isolates the fault;",
    "producer = emitted when producing a record, never by a verifier;",
    "deferred = named so the tier boundary is explicit, NOT part of conformance",
    "at this version."
